#: Youtube_settings.py:308
msgid ""
"How to get YouTube cookies:\n"
"\n"
"1. Install 'Get cookies.txt' extension in Chrome or Firefox\n"
"2. Login to YouTube in your browser\n"
"3. Click the extension icon and export cookies\n"
"4. Save as cookies.txt and select it here\n"
"\n"
"Using cookies helps avoid blocks because YouTube sees you as a logged-in user.\n"
msgstr ""
"Paano kumuha ng YouTube cookies:\n"
"\n"
"1. I-install ang extension na 'Get cookies.txt' sa Chrome o Firefox\n"
"2. Mag-login sa YouTube sa iyong browser\n"
"3. I-click ang extension icon at i-export ang cookies\n"
"4. I-save bilang cookies.txt at piliin ito rito\n"
"\n"
"Ang paggamit ng cookies ay nakakatulong para maiwasan ang mga block dahil makikita ka ng YouTube bilang logged-in na user.\n"

